DRB drb steps to modify inward param parameters

--------------------

Table Name
GW_VENDOR_OTH

Primary Key
VENDOR_ID = 2 (Instapay id)
API_ID = 202 (Instapay Inward id)

Field Code Description
API_PUB_KEY - Bancnet Public Key (Public key send by bancnet)
BNK_PRI_KEY - SBA Inward Private Key (Private key generate from SBA/Infopro)
MALL_ID - Inward Mall ID
MERCHANT_ID - Inward Merchant ID
PWD - Inward Password (User Password created by SBA/Infopro)
USR_ID - Inward User ID (User ID created by SBA/Infopro)

Script to Generate Private Key and Public Key
// generate private key
openssl genrsa -out private-test.pem 1024
// convert private key to PKCS8 (java only support PKCS8)
openssl pkcs8 -topk8 -inform PEM -in private-test.pem -out private-test-pkcs8.pem -nocrypt
// generate public key
openssl rsa -in private-test.pem -outform PEM -pubout -out public-test.pem

Steps to Copy Public Key and Pass to Bancnet (Must do before changing private key)
1) Open public-test.pem
2) Copy content following -----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY----- <copy here> -----END PUBLIC KEY-----
3) Send copied content to bancnet

Steps to Replace Private Key
1) Generate Keys using above method.
2) Open private-test-pkcs8.pem
3) Copy content following -----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY----- <copy here> -----END PRIVATE KEY-----
4) Paste copied content in BNK_PRI_KEY (Use provided script provided in Appendix 1)

Generate Password (Run in putty) & Replace in GW_VENDOR_OTH Table
1) openssl rand -base64 32
2) echo -n "<username + copy from number 1>" | openssl dgst -sha256
example: echo -n "bancnetInwardAuwlwNYomKlgZVZmF7NTKXIWAPg8DAZSQsmZ5a9GrEM=" | openssl dgst -sha256
3) Send username and password to bancnet
4) Paste copied content in PWD (Use provided script provided in Appendix 2)

