API_PUB_KEY - Bancnet Public Key (Public key send by bancnet)
BNK_PRI_KEY - SBA Inward Private Key (Private key generate from SBA/Infopro)
MALL_ID - Inward Mall ID
MERCHANT_ID - Inward Merchant ID
PWD - Inward Password (User Password created by SBA/Infopro)
USR_ID - Inward User ID (User ID created by SBA/Infopro)

Script to Generate Private Key and Public Key
// generate private key
openssl genrsa -out private-test.pem 1024
// convert private key to PKCS8 (java only support PKCS8)
openssl pkcs8 -topk8 -inform PEM -in private-test.pem -out private-test-pkcs8.pem -nocrypt
// generate public key
openssl rsa -in private-test.pem -outform PEM -pubout -out public-test.pem

